## Non-linear lung digital twin

:::: {.columns}

::: {.column width="42%"}

![](Schemes/lung_pressure_zoomed.svg){width=70% fig-align="center"}

$$
\begin{aligned}
\Pi = & \int_{\Omega_0} \Psi_{\text{SVK}}\left(\matrice{E}\right) \mathrm{d}V - \int_{\Omega_0} \vect{f}\left(\theta, \phi\right) \cdot \vect{u} \, \mathrm{d}V \\
& + \frac{1}{2}\int_{\partial \Omega_0} k_b \left( \vect{u}\cdot \vect{N} \right)^2 \mathrm{d}S - \int_{\Omega_0} p\left(\vect{X} + \vect{u}\right) J \, \mathrm{d}V
\end{aligned}
$$

* **6 parameters**: $E$, $\left(\theta, \phi\right)$, $\left(p_0, H, K\right)$
* Follower pressure $p = p_0 + H\left(z-z_0 \right) + K\left(y-y_0 \right)$
  * $\delta \Pi_p = - \int_{\partial \Omega_0} p \, J \matrice{F}^{-T} \vect{N} \cdot \delta \vect{u} \, \mathrm{d}S$


